{
  "_comment": [
    "阶段 A + B 的可执行计划（跑训练之前先跑这个）。路径全走变量，避免 ../ 层级搞错；用法：",
    "$EXAMPLES=<repo>/examples/training 指向示例数据；脚本与基准证据仍用 $TRAIN。",
    "  python run_plan.py plan.stage-ab.json --set ENV_PY=python3 --set MEZO=<Strata-mezo 绝对路径> \\",
    "      --set GGUF1=<shard1.gguf> --set GGUF2=<shard2.gguf> --set EXPERT_PROFILE=<expert-profile.bin> --set ADAPTER=<adapter.gguf> \\",
    "      --set GGUF=<shard1.gguf> --set EXPERT_PROFILE=<expert-profile.bin> --set ADAPTER=<adapter.gguf> \\",
    "      --set CORPUS=$TRAIN/_discard/corpus.npy --set ENGINE=<strata 绝对路径> --set BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8080",
    "PACK 是 tokenizer 所在的**目录**（引擎侧与分词用）；PACK_EXPERTS 是 HF 侧的 nf4 专家文件，",
    "HF 侧 --gguf 要**两个分片都传**（loader 按名字找张量，缺一个就 KeyError）；引擎侧只吃第一个。",
    "**必须带 .bin**：loader_qwen4 读 `<PACK_EXPERTS>.json` 拿每层偏移，给目录会报 FileNotFound。",
    "PYTHONUTF8=1 必须：否则 GDN 会静默回落到 torch 参考实现，数字不可用（bench 会自己拒绝跑）。",
    "a1_eval_base 需要一个已经起好的 serve（先起、跑完再停：它和 b2 抢同一块卡）；",
    "b3_iface 自己拉起引擎/serve，不需要外部服务。"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "a0_prep_data",
      "_why": "身份 26→8、数学 36→12；选择规则写死在脚本里，数据改了就报错而不是悄悄换行",
      "cmd": [
        "$ENV_PY",
        "$TRAIN/prep_eval_data.py",
        "--math",
        "$MEZO/examples/training/math_prompts.jsonl"
      ],
      "cwd": "$TRAIN"
    },
    {
      "name": "b1_budget",
      "_why": "先算，不先试：每方案在这台机器上能训多长（含 KV 档位与峰值）",
      "cmd": [
        "$ENV_PY",
        "$TRAIN/budget.py",
        "--json",
        "$TRAIN/bench_budget.json"
      ],
      "cwd": "$TRAIN"
    },
    {
      "name": "b1_pack",
      "_why": "把我们自己的训练文本分成一条扁平流，bench 的 --tokens-npy 只认它（否则 tok/s 只能算合成）",
      "cmd": [
        "$ENV_PY",
        "$MEZO/examples/training/prep_pack.py",
        "--pack",
        "$PACK",
        "--src",
        "$EXAMPLES/data_identity8.jsonl",
        "$EXAMPLES/math_12.jsonl",
        "$MEZO/examples/training/dpo_math.jsonl",
        "--out",
        "$CORPUS",
        "--check-t",
        "8192,32768,131072"
      ],
      "cwd": "$TRAIN"
    },
    {
      "name": "a1_eval_base",
      "_why": "基座基准分：身份 logp / 能力 CE / 生成体检，走引擎的 /v1/engine/score（须先 --lora 起好 serve）",
      "cmd": [
        "$ENV_PY",
        "$MEZO/examples/training/evalset.py",
        "--pack",
        "$PACK",
        "--base",
        "$BASE",
        "--word",
        "xiezhipeng-git",
        "--sets",
        "identity:$EXAMPLES/prompts_identity.jsonl",
        "holdout:$EXAMPLES/prompts_holdout.jsonl",
        "--tier",
        "full",
        "--gen",
        "2",
        "--out",
        "$TRAIN/eval_base.json"
      ],
      "cwd": "$TRAIN",
      "on_fail": "continue"
    },
    {
      "name": "b2_bench",
      "_why": "一格一步：每方案在 {T_model/2, T_model} 两点各跑一步。退出码 3 = 某格挂死（已落盘），--resume 续跑",
      "cmd": [
        "$ENV_PY",
        "$TRAIN/bench_fullctx.py",
        "--gguf",
        "$GGUF1",
        "$GGUF2",
        "--pack",
        "$PACK_EXPERTS",
        "--tokenizer",
        "$PACK",
        "--from-budget",
        "$TRAIN/bench_budget.json",
        "--algos",
        "ce,dpo,grpo",
        "--modes",
        "mezo,bwd",
        "--group",
        "2",
        "--reps",
        "1",
        "--warmup",
        "0",
        "--on-oom",
        "skip",
        "--per-cell-timeout",
        "auto",
        "--tokens-npy",
        "$CORPUS",
        "--out",
        "$TRAIN/bench_limits.json"
      ],
      "cwd": "$TRAIN",
      "timeout": 10800,
      "retry_on": {
        "3": {
          "times": 6
        }
      },
      "append": [
        "--resume"
      ],
      "on_fail": "continue"
    },
    {
      "name": "b2_judge",
      "_why": "极限 / 降速 / 公式三条判据；非零退出就说明有不该继续的信号",
      "cmd": [
        "$ENV_PY",
        "$TRAIN/judge_limits.py",
        "$TRAIN/bench_limits.json",
        "--budget",
        "$TRAIN/bench_budget.json",
        "--out",
        "$TRAIN/judge_b.json"
      ],
      "cwd": "$TRAIN",
      "on_fail": "continue"
    },
    {
      "name": "b3_iface",
      "_why": "同一份 128K 序列、同一份引擎参数：走 serve 的 HTTP 接口（训练实际通道）比直连管道多多少；顺带验两条通道的 Σ 是不是同一份 θ±ε（对不上就是缓存污染）（引擎只需要第一个分片；HF 侧 bench_fullctx 要两个都传，否则 KeyError blk.N.ffn_down_shexp.weight）",
      "cmd": [
        "$ENV_PY",
        "$MEZO/tools/bench_engine_iface.py",
        "--engine",
        "$ENGINE",
        "--pack",
        "$PACK",
        "--native",
        "$GGUF1",
        "--expert-profile",
        "$EXPERT_PROFILE",
        "--lora",
        "$ADAPTER",
        "--tokens-npy",
        "$CORPUS",
        "--seqlen",
        "131072",
        "--reps",
        "2",
        "--via",
        "pipe,http",
        "--out",
        "$TRAIN/bench_iface.json",
        "--log-dir",
        "$TRAIN"
      ],
      "cwd": "$TRAIN",
      "timeout": 5400,
      "on_fail": "continue"
    }
  ]
}